---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy | Blocked Drains Northern Beaches" description="Read how this website handles phone enquiries, property details, hosting data and Google Analytics, and how to contact our team with privacy questions." crumbs={[{name:'Privacy',href:'/privacy'}]}>
  <div class="wrap intro-page"><h1>Privacy</h1></div><article class="wrap legal"><p>This website provides information about our drainage services. The operating business is identified in the footer.</p><h2>Phone Enquiries</h2><p>When you contact the team, the information you provide—such as your name, contact details, property address, symptoms and access instructions—is used to discuss your enquiry and arrange the requested service. Please provide only information relevant to the job.</p><h2>Website Visits</h2><p>This site has no online enquiry form, account registration or online payment facility. The hosting provider may process technical request information, such as IP address and browser details, to deliver and protect the website. Videos and photographs are served directly from the site.</p><h2>Website Analytics</h2><p>This website uses Google Analytics, which may collect website usage information and phone-link click events using cookies or similar technologies. Clicking the call link does not establish that a call was completed. Browser settings and available privacy controls can limit cookies. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s privacy information</a>.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about information provided with an enquiry, call <a class="inline-call" href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a>. This page describes this website’s features and enquiry handling; ask the team about specific service records or access requests.</p></article>
</Layout>
